{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01636","headline":"杂曲歌辞 妾薄命 · 张籍","name":"杂曲歌辞 妾薄命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薄命妇，良家子，无事从军去万里。\n汉家天子平四夷，护羌都尉裹屍归。\n念君此行爲死别，对君裁缝泉下衣。\n与君一日爲夫妇，千年万岁亦相守。\n君爱龙城征战功，妾愿青楼欢乐同。\n人生各各有所欲，讵得将心入君腹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01636.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01636","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}